    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/7c166adf2beedc47022d805cad78b202.avif?t=1729022873\" /></div>Explore and uncover the Spooky Mysteries surrounding Grimfield in this Action Adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/45cf495f18de15b981f45a5f5908db28.poster.avif?t=1729022873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/45cf495f18de15b981f45a5f5908db28.webp?t=1729022873\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Grimfield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grimfield is a small town that has drawn attention by mysterious and unexplained events that have recently taken place there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Lucas\u2019 parents are in love with everything related to the paranormal, the family traveled to Grimfield\u2019s forest to investigate\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/4aea996851299e7190ffca7e5fb198ed.poster.avif?t=1729022873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/4aea996851299e7190ffca7e5fb198ed.webm?t=1729022873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Amulet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On their way to Grimfield, a mysterious object was given to them, an antique amulet\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This magic amulet summons a magic hand that becomes an extension of Lucas, allowing him to activate and grab elements far from him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/0702c972f087ded515841c3864630be3.poster.avif?t=1729022873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/0702c972f087ded515841c3864630be3.webm?t=1729022873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/0702c972f087ded515841c3864630be3.mp4?t=1729022873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique action gameplay with a floating magic hand mechanique!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great 3D + 2D Cartoonish Art style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mysterious adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awesome OST!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/78244652228a7e3a8712971deb334536.avif?t=1729022873\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nachon Lab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ogre Pixel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2023</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/7c166adf2beedc47022d805cad78b202.avif?t=1729022873\" /></div>Explore and uncover the Spooky Mysteries surrounding Grimfield in this Action Adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/45cf495f18de15b981f45a5f5908db28.poster.avif?t=1729022873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/45cf495f18de15b981f45a5f5908db28.webp?t=1729022873\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About Grimfield</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grimfield is a small town that has drawn attention by mysterious and unexplained events that have recently taken place there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Lucas\u2019 parents are in love with everything related to the paranormal, the family traveled to Grimfield\u2019s forest to investigate\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/4aea996851299e7190ffca7e5fb198ed.poster.avif?t=1729022873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/4aea996851299e7190ffca7e5fb198ed.webm?t=1729022873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Amulet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On their way to Grimfield, a mysterious object was given to them, an antique amulet\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This magic amulet summons a magic hand that becomes an extension of Lucas, allowing him to activate and grab elements far from him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/0702c972f087ded515841c3864630be3.poster.avif?t=1729022873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/0702c972f087ded515841c3864630be3.webm?t=1729022873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/0702c972f087ded515841c3864630be3.mp4?t=1729022873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique action gameplay with a floating magic hand mechanique!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great 3D + 2D Cartoonish Art style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mysterious adventure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awesome OST!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214180/extras/78244652228a7e3a8712971deb334536.avif?t=1729022873\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nachon Lab</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ogre Pixel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2023</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
